 Photos: Ina Garten, Matt Rogers, Busy Philipps, More Attend a Starry Opening Night at Broadway's Other Desert Cities 
 Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Ed Harris, and Allison Janney lead the Jon Robin Baitz play's Main Stem return.
 October 19, 2026 
 By Logan Culwell-Block 
 Ina Garten
 (Shawn Salley)
 October 18 was opening night for  Other Desert Cities on Broadway, and the stars were out in full force to cheer on Julia Louis-Dreyfus ' long-awaited Broadway debut! Amongst the celebrity revelers at the Hudson Theatre were Dan Bucatinsky, Bradley Whitford , Margo Martindale , Clark Gregg , Matt Rogers , Kelly Ripa, Mark Consuelos , Victor Garber , Matthew Broderick , Sarah Jessica Parker , Busy Philipps, Bryan Cranston , J.J. Abrams , Ina Garten, Chris Perfetti , Andy Cohen, Lance LePere, Annie Leibovitz, Anna Wintour, Michael Kors , Robin de Jesús, and many more.
 Hit the red carpet in the photo gallery below, which also includes images of the Cities  cast taking their opening night Broadway bow. See what critics had to say about the revival here .
